Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-10-2000||10:34 PM||||uum local vinyl shop would work.. What kind of "decal" are you looking for? PLEASE don't advertise for anyone that hasn't given your or cut you one smoking deal on parts or service. (eg. MOMOCORSE, or DC Sports) I can't tell ya how may kids in slow annoying Jettas or even the gimped out taurus with a DC sticker DC ONLY MAKES THINGS FOR HONDAS GET OVER IT!!! sorry.. didn't mean to get upset... before you go spending money on vinyl you might want to think twice and go to   <A HREF="http://www.riceboypage.com" TARGET=_blank>www.riceboypage.com</A>   please don't deface your car just for a the ooh and aaagh of some local slow import scene.  I'll admit i have a set of stickers on my car. front windshield in car matching gold  ( <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net" TARGET=_blank>www.engineered.net</A>  ) and on the back window Engineered Performance Logo and phone #. I've spent a rather healthy sum of money at thier shop and they have done WAY more than their fair share of free work and free parts. But I've also made them quite a bit of dough by showing my tail lights to a Mustang owner or two... "...I got beat by this guy in a Fiero... what can I do to be faster than he.."  Please visit the Rice boy page I have linked and make sure your not gunna fit into that catagoy with whatever sticker you had in mind... ||||reg||1
