Z||000007||stimpy||03-11-2000||12:25 AM||||I take it that you are talking about those "visor" bands that keep you from seeing when the light turns green?  I found the perfect source for you... my favorite place- Wal Mart (quit snickering Patrick) No really. Its called contact paper and you can even get some lovely prints and patterns. Maybe a nice floral look.<BR>  Yes, I am being a smart ass. Really, don't do it. Aside from the above mentioned street racing handicap and their dubious legality, there really is no benefit to these other then aping the already derivitive rice-boy look. If you want some kind of fashion statement on your windshield, take a cue fro DXR_DAD and have a custom design made up by a sign shop. That way you can look cool and still see the stoplight.<BR>Two Pennies, take 'em or leave 'em.||||reg||1
